<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Remote Skills & Opportunity Roadmap</title>

<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<style>

:root{
    --green:#5bbf8a;
    --dark:#14532d;
    --light:#f5fff9;
    --card:#ffffff;
    --text:#444;
    --shadow:0 12px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.08);
}

*{
    margin:0;
    padding:0;
    box-sizing:border-box;
    font-family:'Poppins',sans-serif;
}

body{
    background:var(--light);
    color:var(--text);
    line-height:1.8;
}

/* HERO */

header{
    background:linear-gradient(135deg,#5bbf8a,#7fe3b0);
    color:white;
    text-align:center;
    padding:100px 8%;
}

header h1{
    font-size:3.5rem;
    margin-bottom:20px;
}

header p{
    max-width:900px;
    margin:auto;
    font-size:1.1rem;
}

/* LESSONS */

.lesson{
    padding:80px 8%;
}

.lesson:nth-child(even){
    background:white;
}

.lesson h2{
    text-align:center;
    color:var(--dark);
    font-size:2.3rem;
    margin-bottom:25px;
}

.lesson h2::after{
    content:"";
    width:100px;
    height:5px;
    background:var(--green);
    display:block;
    margin:15px auto;
    border-radius:50px;
}

.lesson p{
    max-width:900px;
    margin:0 auto 20px;
}

/* INTRO CARD */

.intro-card{
    max-width:1000px;
    margin:auto;
    background:white;
    padding:35px;
    border-radius:20px;
    box-shadow:var(--shadow);
}

/* FRAMEWORK */

.framework{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(300px,1fr));
    gap:30px;
    margin-top:40px;
}

.framework div{
    background:white;
    padding:30px;
    border-radius:20px;
    box-shadow:var(--shadow);
    border-top:6px solid var(--green);
    transition:.3s;
}

.framework div:hover{
    transform:translateY(-8px);
}

.framework h3{
    color:var(--dark);
    margin-bottom:15px;
}

.framework ul{
    padding-left:20px;
}

.framework li{
    margin-bottom:10px;
}

/* EXAMPLES */

.examples{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(250px,1fr));
    gap:25px;
    margin-top:40px;
}

.examples div{
    background:white;
    border-radius:18px;
    padding:25px;
    text-align:center;
    box-shadow:var(--shadow);
    transition:.3s;
}

.examples div:hover{
    transform:translateY(-8px);
}

.examples h3{
    color:var(--dark);
    margin-bottom:10px;
}

/* PATHWAYS */

.pathway{
    background:white;
    padding:30px;
    border-radius:20px;
    margin-bottom:25px;
    border-left:8px solid var(--green);
    box-shadow:var(--shadow);
}

.pathway h3{
    color:var(--dark);
    margin-bottom:10px;
}

/* TABLE */

table{
    width:100%;
    border-collapse:collapse;
    margin-top:40px;
    background:white;
    border-radius:20px;
    overflow:hidden;
    box-shadow:var(--shadow);
}

th{
    background:var(--green);
    color:white;
    padding:18px;
    text-align:left;
}

td{
    padding:18px;
    border-bottom:1px solid #eee;
}

tr:nth-child(even){
    background:#f7fff9;
}

/* AI LIST */

.lesson ul{
    max-width:900px;
    margin:30px auto;
    padding-left:25px;
}

.lesson ul li{
    margin-bottom:12px;
}

/* HIGHLIGHT */

.highlight{
    max-width:1000px;
    margin:40px auto 0;
    background:linear-gradient(135deg,#5bbf8a,#7fe3b0);
    color:white;
    padding:35px;
    border-radius:20px;
    text-align:center;
}

.highlight h3{
    margin-bottom:15px;
}

/* FOOTER */

footer{
    background:#103a22;
    color:white;
    text-align:center;
    padding:40px;
}

/* RESPONSIVE */

@media(max-width:768px){

header h1{
    font-size:2.5rem;
}

.lesson h2{
    font-size:1.8rem;
}

.framework,
.examples{
    grid-template-columns:1fr;
}

table{
    display:block;
    overflow-x:auto;
}

}

</style>
</head>

<body>

<header>

<h1>Remote Skills & Opportunity Roadmap</h1>

<p>
The internet has created thousands of ways to earn income, build a career,
and create opportunities. The people who succeed are often those who
continuously learn and develop valuable skills.
</p>

</header>

<section class="lesson">

<h2>Why Upskilling Matters</h2>

<div class="intro-card">

<p>
Technology changes rapidly. Many jobs disappear, evolve, or become automated.
People who continuously learn often have access to more opportunities,
greater flexibility, and higher income potential.
</p>

<p>
Upskilling means improving existing skills or learning new ones that increase
your value in the marketplace.
</p>

</div>

</section>

<section class="lesson">

<h2>The Three Skill Categories</h2>

<div class="framework">

<div>

<h3>Foundational Skills</h3>

<ul>
<li>Communication</li>
<li>Writing</li>
<li>Organization</li>
<li>Problem Solving</li>
<li>Critical Thinking</li>
</ul>

</div>

<div>

<h3>Technical Skills</h3>

<ul>
<li>Data Analysis</li>
<li>Cybersecurity</li>
<li>Coding</li>
<li>Cloud Computing</li>
<li>AI Tools</li>
</ul>

</div>

<div>

<h3>Business Skills</h3>

<ul>
<li>Marketing</li>
<li>Sales</li>
<li>Project Management</li>
<li>Leadership</li>
<li>Customer Success</li>
</ul>

</div>

</div>

</section>

<section class="lesson">

<h2>The Power Of Skill Stacking</h2>

<p>
High earners often combine multiple skills. The value is rarely found in a
single skill. It comes from how skills work together.
</p>

<div class="examples">

<div>
<h3>Marketing + AI</h3>
<p>Create content faster and improve productivity.</p>
</div>

<div>
<h3>Writing + SEO</h3>
<p>Generate search traffic and attract audiences.</p>
</div>

<div>
<h3>Project Management + Communication</h3>
<p>Lead teams and improve collaboration.</p>
</div>

<div>
<h3>Data Analysis + Business Knowledge</h3>
<p>Make stronger business decisions.</p>
</div>

</div>

</section>

<section class="lesson">

<h2>Remote Career Pathways</h2>

<div class="pathway">
<h3>Customer Service Path</h3>
<p>Customer Service → Team Lead → Operations Coordinator → Operations Manager</p>
</div>

<div class="pathway">
<h3>Marketing Path</h3>
<p>Content Creator → Marketing Assistant → Marketing Specialist → Marketing Manager</p>
</div>

<div class="pathway">
<h3>Technology Path</h3>
<p>IT Support → System Administrator → Cloud Engineer → Solutions Architect</p>
</div>

</section>

<section class="lesson">

<h2>High-Value Skills With Free Learning Resources</h2>

<table>

<tr>
<th>Skill</th>
<th>Resource</th>
<th>Cost</th>
</tr>

<tr>
<td>Digital Marketing</td>
<td>Google Skillshop</td>
<td>Free</td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td>CRM Systems</td>
<td>HubSpot Academy</td>
<td>Free</td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td>Coding</td>
<td>FreeCodeCamp</td>
<td>Free</td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td>Cybersecurity</td>
<td>Cisco Skills For All</td>
<td>Free</td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td>Cloud Computing</td>
<td>AWS Skill Builder</td>
<td>Free</td>
</tr>

</table>

</section>

<section class="lesson">

<h2>AI & The Future Of Work</h2>

<p>
Artificial intelligence is changing how work is performed. Many routine tasks
are becoming automated. The most resilient workers learn how to use AI instead
of competing against it.
</p>

<ul>

<li>Use AI to research topics quickly</li>

<li>Use AI to brainstorm ideas</li>

<li>Use AI to summarize information</li>

<li>Use AI to improve writing</li>

<li>Use AI to automate repetitive tasks</li>

<li>Use AI to organize projects</li>

<li>Use AI to create first drafts</li>

<li>Use AI to learn new concepts faster</li>

</ul>

<div class="highlight">

<h3>Key Lesson</h3>

<p>
The future belongs to people who combine human skills such as communication,
creativity, leadership, and critical thinking with technology skills such as
AI, data analysis, and digital tools.
</p>

</div>

</section>

<footer>

<h3>Keep Learning. Keep Building.</h3>

<p>
Every skill you develop expands the number of opportunities available to you.
The goal isn't just finding a job. The goal is becoming valuable enough to
create options.
</p>

</footer>

</body>
</html>
